{
  "_doc": "Stream E (M2). The event director's list (PLAN §5.2). `director` = the realm rules (ONE big event at a time, sized to who is online and in band, announced 10 minutes ahead, waystone travel to it free while it runs). `realm` = the big events, each on a schedule or a trigger; the province world boss Grimtallow is a fixed-time scheduled event. `zone` = the per-zone event bosses, each running on its own in every zone copy at stream B's event arena (`site` = the arena id in data/zones/<world zone>/placements.json): two waves from the zone's camp mix, then the boss (an encounter script id in data/encounters/). Everyone within autoEnrolMetres joins a temporary event group (PLAN §5.3). Times are real minutes; reward xp = share of a level's XP, gold = multiple of a kill's gold (data/quests/README.md).",
  "director": {
    "oneRealmEventAtATime": true,
    "announceMinutes": 10,
    "reminderMinutes": [
      5,
      1
    ],
    "freeWaystoneTravel": true,
    "gapMinutes": [
      40,
      80
    ],
    "inBandLevels": 3,
    "size": {
      "healthPerPlayer": 0.12,
      "addWavePerPlayers": 6,
      "minPlayers": 1,
      "capPlayers": 60,
      "note": "Boss health x (1 + healthPerPlayer x (enrolled - 1)), one extra add per addWavePerPlayers enrolled; soak/stack needs come from the encounter script's own `party` note."
    },
    "pick": "Of the events whose minOnline is met and whose cooldown is over, the scheduled one due soonest wins; otherwise weighted by `weight`. An event whose zone has fewer than minInBand characters in band is skipped.",
    "credit": "By contribution (damage, healing, soaks); loot is personal."
  },
  "realm": [
